{"at": "2026-07-29T01:14:43.921986+00:00", "event_id": "01KYNQ0BTJ0G9CRFWPD5QE4D32", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01KYNPJG8V4WVGJTRS393EPF4P", "final_answer": "grow-monolithic: keep one fixed latest-value ParameterSnapshot and widen it to patches[16] x effects[3] x scalars[8], tracks[16] with sends[8], and returns[8]. One transport, one revision, fixed layout preserved.", "mission_id": "01KYNGX8QA8V49BX2WQ1Q6G2BP", "mission_slug": "expandable-effects-and-bus-topology-01KYNGX8", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-07-29T01:14:43.921986Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01KYNPJG8V4WVGJTRS393EPF4P", "state_entered_at": "2026-07-29T01:14:43.921159Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-07-29T01:14:44.606725+00:00", "event_id": "01KYNQ0CFYZGA7EYZFEYXRJCVV", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01KYNPJGZE4SHHASMVDCY2ET42", "final_answer": "retire-port: delete port.Mixer.GlobalEffectsProcessor entirely. Reverb and delay become ordinary registry effect capabilities and preparers using the same generic prepared-effect boundary as Chorus. Rationale from user: the port was closed against extension that was always declared, violating open-closed; one effect model must exist, not two.", "mission_id": "01KYNGX8QA8V49BX2WQ1Q6G2BP", "mission_slug": "expandable-effects-and-bus-topology-01KYNGX8", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-07-29T01:14:44.606725Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01KYNPJGZE4SHHASMVDCY2ET42", "state_entered_at": "2026-07-29T01:14:44.605916Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-07-29T01:14:45.304344+00:00", "event_id": "01KYNQ0D5RKT0XXXRZZAEPKMET", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01KYNPJHVFZ0Y9EDEHCQ7CHHYK", "final_answer": "Polymorphic generic addressing, not enumeration. Nothing in the mixer track is hardcoded per effect: a track owns sends as a fixed array of one generic send value type addressed by BusId. Parameter identity is descriptor-driven and index-addressed rather than a named enum variant per destination. Same rule applies to Patch effect slots and bus returns.", "mission_id": "01KYNGX8QA8V49BX2WQ1Q6G2BP", "mission_slug": "expandable-effects-and-bus-topology-01KYNGX8", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": true, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-07-29T01:14:45.304344Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01KYNPJHVFZ0Y9EDEHCQ7CHHYK", "state_entered_at": "2026-07-29T01:14:45.303488Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-07-29T01:14:46.002060+00:00", "event_id": "01KYNQ0DVJGYG7VB634A6DSPZS", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01KYNPJJMKR8PY4H9N4FTZ5K2V", "final_answer": "dissolve-into-return-scalars: GlobalParameter retains only MasterGainDb. Reverb/delay tuning values become descriptor scalars of their registry entries; return level is owned per bus return.", "mission_id": "01KYNGX8QA8V49BX2WQ1Q6G2BP", "mission_slug": "expandable-effects-and-bus-topology-01KYNGX8", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-07-29T01:14:46.002060Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01KYNPJJMKR8PY4H9N4FTZ5K2V", "state_entered_at": "2026-07-29T01:14:46.000387Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
